            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<p class="jarvis-headline">Your plan now lives in Settings › Account.</p>
<h2>Jarvis 0.20.31</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Settings › Account shows your plan in one card: what it is, when it renews or ends, and one button for the next step. The separate Plan page is gone.</li>
  <li>A trial ending, a payment that didn't go through, or a plan that ended now shows as a card in the bottom left of Focus, like the "New version" card. "Later" hides it until tomorrow.</li>
  <li>If your subscription ended, Jarvis now says so, instead of telling you your trial ended.</li>
  <li>On the trial's last day you see the exact time it ends.</li>
  <li>When the trial or subscription ends, the screen asking you to subscribe sits over your day instead of replacing it.</li>
  <li>Settings moved to the top left of Focus. Meetings and the + stay on the right.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
